+
+### 4. Test Coverage: `test_hydrateContentCardRulesEngineFromDisk_loadsDisqualifyRulesIntoMainRulesEngine()`
+
+**File:** `AEPMessaging/Tests/UnitTests/MessagingProcessCompletedEventTests.swift` (lines 637–657)
+
+**Already staged; verifies:**
+- Content-card rules load into `contentCardRulesEngine` ✓
+- Disqualify rules load into main `rulesEngine` ✓
+- Disqualify rules are non-empty ✓
