+## Behavior After Fix
+
+### Offline Qualify/Dismiss Flow
+1. **Boot:** `hydratePropositionsRulesEngine()` loads IAM rules + records in dictionary
+2. **Offline get:** `hydrateContentCardRulesEngineFromDisk()` loads content-card rules + disqualify rules
+3. **Display:** Content card qualifies via `contentCardRulesEngine`; user dismisses
+4. **Dismiss event:** Disqualify consequence fires via main `rulesEngine` (now has the rule loaded)
+5. **Result:** Card removed from qualified set; stays removed offline (no reappear)
+
+### Analytics Provenance
+- Cards served from disk are tagged `.disk` in `contentCardOriginByProposition` (line 1408)
+- Display events report `servedFromPersistentCache: true` for offline-served cards ✓
