+## Summary
+
+Option A fixes the offline dismiss bug by ensuring the `inAppRulesBySurface` dictionary is populated at init time, mirroring the network path's behavior. This allows `hydrateContentCardRulesEngineFromDisk` to safely combine IAM + disqualify rules without clobbering either, while maintaining consistency with AEP's existing design idioms (one engine per semantic, full replace not incremental add).
+
+**Cost:** 1 visibility change + 8 lines of dictionary population + 28 lines of test.  
+**Benefit:** Dismissed content cards no longer reappear offline; architecture stays consistent.